  partName: Sensor (5)
  description: The Sensor (5) is a medium-sized, elongated metal component positioned
    at the middle-center-rear of the jet engine, playing a crucial role in monitoring
    engine parameters such as temperature, pressure, and vibration. Its metal-dark
    material provides electromagnetic shielding, ensuring accurate sensor readings.
    Notably, the sensor's rear location allows for minimal interference from other
    engine components.
